# A cattle market on the road west of Paris (Poissy): the market hall, open on
# its sides, where the drovers bring their beasts from Normandy and the butchers of Paris buy, an
# inn for the drovers, and a few houses, all open to the road.
style village
ground 0.9
margin 14
legend C halle "the cattle market" timber nostalls
legend I inn   "the Lion d'Or"
